00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.743 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Elle a inondé le ruisseau,

00:00:08.042 --> 00:00:10.778 size:53% position:73% line:53%
puis tout le terrain de

00:00:09.076 --> 00:00:11.812 size:53% position:73% line:53%
