00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:42.810 size:53% position:73% line:53%
encore beaucoup à faire.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:44.244 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- 30 jours plus tard,

00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:45.713 size:53% position:73% line:53%
